  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d29874e3b4e59e549ab8ca779e34be5a, type: 3}
  m_Name: Mythical_0-Reconsideration of human
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: T.I.I.G.E.R
  paragraphs:
  - The Andromeda Course?! I thought it was nothing more than an urban legend.
  - I must admit, human, your performance has exceeded our expectations. You may
    very well rival the skill of the Caddi.
  - This is where they were believed to have perfected the Universal Drive, a revolutionary
    technology that allowed interdimensional golf travel.
  - However, be warned, this galaxy is teeming with quasars. Their intense X-rays
    will disintegrate your ball instantly.
  - If you manage to complete this course, I will finally have access to the Universal
    Drive. The potential for cross-dimensional exploration is limitless.
  revealNameLater: 0
  hiddenSpeakerName: 
